        <item>
            <title>0.66</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 09:07:48 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1784044938</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.66</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Voice input</h2>
<ul>
<li>Addy can now transcribe your microphone into the prompt locally. Press ⌥1 or tap the mic button in the chat input to dictate; enable it under Settings → Voice, where you can also download the local transcription model.</li>
<li>Text-to-speech — Assistant replies can be read aloud with a local voice. Each assistant message gets a play button, and an optional setting speaks completed replies automatically. Speech streams in buffered chunks so playback starts sooner, and you can pick a voice and download the local speech model from Settings.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Connect agents</h2>
<ul>
<li>Link two agent chat panes by dragging a cable from one pane&#x27;s plug icon to another&#x27;s socket, so the agents can pass messages directly to each other. Relayed messages appear as agent-to-agent cards in the chat, and a &quot;Connected to Agent&quot; notice confirms the link.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Pane color tags</h2>
<ul>
<li>Right-click an empty area of a pane&#x27;s footer to tag it with a color, shown as a colored border around that pane&#x27;s chat input for quick visual identification.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>The workspace footer bar moved to a header at the top of the workspace; the toggle shortcut is now ⌃⌘. (&quot;Toggle Header&quot;).</li>
<li>Queued messages now stack vertically in the input area instead of scrolling in a horizontal carousel, so pending messages are easier to see at a glance.</li>
<li>⌥1 now starts voice input in the active pane (the previous ⌥1–⌥9 pane-focus shortcuts have been removed).</li>
<li>Local speech models now download as split zip archives with a clearer download and setup flow, and text-to-speech uses a higher-quality 1.7B voice model.</li>
<li>Voice settings are now honored consistently across the chat controls.</li>
<li>addyruncommand now runs in owned subpanes, and subpane navigation arrows are hidden for a cleaner layout.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed stale Git change attribution so the agent or pane credited with a file change is tracked accurately across concurrent operations; also fixed the attribution label that could show raw placeholder text instead of the mode and pane ID.</li>
<li>Fixed queued messages stacking incorrectly in the input area.</li>
<li>Fixed universal (Apple Silicon + Intel) release packaging so the shipped app bundle is built correctly.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>I have a thorough understanding of all the changes. Here&#x27;s the changelog</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
